    },
    {
      "beat_id": "B20",
      "act": "HANDOFF",
      "narration_text": "Your turn. Next time something you built gives you a score, try this first. Feed it one answer you are certain is correct, and check that it says yes. If it says no, you have not found a bad result. You have found a bad ruler.",
